    </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <conbody>
    <p>Converting existing documentation from formats like Word or plain text to DITA requires a systematic approach. The conversion process involves:</p>
    <p>Analyzing source content structure</p>
    <p>Classifying content into DITA topic types</p>
    <p>Creating appropriate XML markup</p>
    <p>Organizing topics in a ditamap</p>
    <p>Managing images and external resources</p>
  </conbody>
